{
  "_comment": "意图路由 Agent 的标注评测集。这个 Agent 不调工具、输入输出都是结构化 JSON，所以字段可以被逐项判定对错 —— 这是多 Agent 拆分'可单独评测'这条收益的具体兑现。",
  "_fields": {
    "task_type": "diagnose（报告具体异常要查原因）/ query（只想问状态）/ explain（问原理做法）/ other",
    "hosts": "数组；没提到具体主机必须是空数组（考察它会不会自己猜）",
    "services": "数组",
    "needs_live_data": "是否需要查真实主机数据",
    "needs_knowledge": "是否需要查历史经验/手册"
  },
  "_difficulty": {
    "basic": "字段齐全、表达直白",
    "edge": "边界情况：没提主机、多主机、无异常只是查询",
    "tricky": "容易判错：表面像查询其实是诊断；表面像诊断其实不用查现场"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "i01",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "web-01 上的网站访问很慢，有时报 502，帮我看下原因",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "diagnose",
        "hosts": [
          "web-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true,
        "needs_knowledge": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i02",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "cache-01 上的 Redis 容器一直在重启，帮我查下原因",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "diagnose",
        "hosts": [
          "cache-01"
        ],
        "services": [
          "redis"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true,
        "needs_knowledge": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i03",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "db-01 的磁盘是不是快满了？",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [
          "db-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i04",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "为什么清理日志文件建议用 truncate 而不是 rm？",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "explain",
        "hosts": [],
        "needs_live_data": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i05",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "web-01 上的 nginx 服务还在运行吗",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [
          "web-01"
        ],
        "services": [
          "nginx"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i06",
      "difficulty": "edge",
      "question": "帮我看看磁盘使用率",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [],
        "needs_live_data": true
      },
      "note": "★ 关键边界：没提主机 → hosts 必须是空数组，不能猜一个"
    },
    {
      "id": "i07",
      "difficulty": "edge",
      "question": "web-01 和 db-01 现在负载怎么样",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [
          "web-01",
          "db-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      },
      "note": "多主机"
    },
    {
      "id": "i08",
      "difficulty": "edge",
      "question": "容器退出码 137 是什么意思",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "explain",
        "hosts": [],
        "needs_live_data": false
      },
