      "expect": {
        "task_type": "other",
        "hosts": [],
        "needs_live_data": false
      },
      "note": "完全无关的问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "difficulty": "edge",
      "question": "怎么给 nginx 做滚动重启",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "explain",
        "hosts": [],
        "services": [
          "nginx"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "difficulty": "edge",
      "question": "web-01 的内存还有多少",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [
          "web-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "difficulty": "basic",
      "question": "db-01 的 mysql 连不上了，报 Too many connections",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "diagnose",
        "hosts": [
          "db-01"
        ],
        "services": [
          "mysql"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true,
        "needs_knowledge": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "difficulty": "tricky",
      "question": "db-01 最近的负载好像有点高吧？",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "query",
        "hosts": [
          "db-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      },
      "note": "★ 带'好像'的软描述 + 句尾问号，容易被判成 diagnose（因为没有具体异常，判 query 更准）"
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "difficulty": "tricky",
      "question": "web-01 的负载是不是太高了，要不要扩容",
      "expect": {
        "task_type": "diagnose",
        "hosts": [
          "web-01"
        ],
        "needs_live_data": true
      },
      "note": "★ 表面像 query（问当前负载），也可以判 diagnose（要判断+给建议）。**两种都说得通** —— 硬钉一个只会让指标失去可信度。",
      "accept": {
        "task_type": [
          "query",
          "diagnose"
        ]
      }
    },
